Template: vtun/passwords
Type: note
Description: information about readable passwords
 vtun up to version 2.5-1 has the permissions of /etc/vtund.conf 
 set to 644. There are passwords for the vtun link contained in 
 this file. I will now make the file 600, but if you have local 
 users that you don't trust, you should change the passwords it 
 contains.
